# What Vercel uploads. Without this the whole working tree goes up: the Figma
# dumps alone are ~160MB, and the generator scripts, harvested JSON and internal
# handover docs would all be served from the public staging URL.
#
# The deployed site is only the built HTML pages plus assets/. Everything a page
# needs is already inlined at build time by _postbuild.py, so none of the
# fragments or scripts below are fetched at runtime.
#
# `_v2/` is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the V2 homepage preview and the point
# of staging is to look at it. That is why the patterns below are `_*.ext` rather
# than a blanket `_*`, which would swallow the directory too.

# Generator scripts, chrome, injected fragments, cached REST pulls
_*.py
_*.html
_*.json

# Figma dumps and build inputs
aeonx-node.json
aeonx-mobile.json
aeonx-home-geo.json
aeonx-v2.json
assets.zip
private.zip

# Editor and sync backups
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.stale-*
index.html.bak-*
index.html.pre-*

# Django backend: served from EC2 behind CloudFront, never from the static host
backend/

# Internal notes and client deliverables, not public pages
GO-LIVE-REPORT.md
HANDOFF.md
PROGRESS.md
blog-fetch.md
legacy_pdfs_missing.md
legacy_pdfs_needed.txt
legacy_pdfs_urls.txt
AeonX-Deployment-Architecture.pdf
MISSING_DOCUMENTS.txt
CLAUDE.md

# Client product reels: 1080p masters, ~150-200MB each. The 720p encodes that
# actually ship live are in assets/video/ (singular) and are NOT ignored.
assets/videos/

# Tooling
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
.claude/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pem

# ---- generated: assets/gen PNG allowlist ----
# 275 of the 357 PNGs in assets/gen are dead weight: _webp.py re-encoded them and
# repointed every page at the .webp twin. Rather than list the dead ones, drop all
# PNGs there and re-include only the 82 still requested. The list is built from the
# built pages PLUS the product-tab panels, which are only ever referenced from
# _prodtabs.html at runtime and so appear in no page source.
# Regenerate after a _webp.py run, a rebuild, or a _prodtabs.html regeneration.
assets/gen/*.png
